openapi: 3.0.3
info:
  title: VORA Platform API
  version: 1.0.0
  description: "\n# VORA — Plateforme Taxi Jaune (Cameroun)\n\nAPI REST unifiée pour
    l'écosystème **VORA** : application passager, cockpit chauffeur (taxi jaune),\ngéolocalisation
    PostGIS, optimisation de tournées, paiements Mobile Money simulés et administration.\n\n**Production
    :** `https://vora-ujbv.onrender.com/api/v1`  \n**Documentation interactive :**
    `/api/v1/docs/`  \n**Schéma OpenAPI :** `/api/v1/schema/`\n\n---\n\n## Architecture
    système\n\n| Couche | Rôle |\n|--------|------|\n| **Frontend** (mobile / web)
    | UI passager & chauffeur — consomme cette API |\n| **Django (ce service)** |
    Auth JWT, courses, paiements simulés, zones/carrefours, trajectoires, optimisation
    PostGIS |\n| **PostgreSQL + PostGIS** | Données géo (zones, carrefours, corridors,
    positions chauffeurs) |\n| **Google Maps API** | Géocodage, itinéraires, congestion
    |\n| **Spring Boot** *(optionnel)* | Réservations — appelle `verify-destination`
    et `optimize/turn` |\n\n---\n\n## Rôles utilisateur\n\n| Rôle | `role` JWT | Espace
    frontend | Endpoints principaux |\n|------|------------|-----------------|----------------------|\n|
    **Passager** | `passenger` | `pickup` — commander une course | `/rides/*`, `/payments/*`,
    `/safety/sos` |\n| **Chauffeur** | `driver` | `driver-cockpit` — habitacle & revenus
    | `/driver/*`, `/drivers/online` (lecture) |\n| **Admin** | `admin` *(futur)*
    | Dashboard ops | `/admin/*` |\n\nAprès connexion, utiliser `user.redirect_dashboard`
    : `pickup` ou `driver-cockpit`.\n\n---\n\n## Authentification\n\n1. **Inscription**
    — `POST /auth/signup` (`role`: `passenger` \\| `driver`)\n2. **OTP** — `POST /auth/otp/verify`
    avec code **`1234`** (simulation, pas d'email réel)\n3. **Connexion** — `POST
    /auth/signin` → `access_token` JWT (24 h)\n4. **Requêtes protégées** — header
    `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>`\n5. **Profil** — `GET /auth/me`\n\nCliquez
    **Authorize** en haut à droite et entrez : `Bearer eyJ...`\n\n---\n\n## Données
    de test (seed)\n\nCommande : `python manage.py seed_vora`\n\n| Entité | Quantité
    | Villes |\n|--------|----------|--------|\n| Passagers | 50 | Yaoundé & Douala
    |\n| Chauffeurs (taximen jaunes) | 10 | Yaoundé & Douala |\n| Carrefours | 32
    | GPS réels |\n| Lignes / corridors | 6 | Y1–Y3, D1–D3 |\n\n**Mot de passe (tous
    les comptes seed) :** `pass12345`\n\n| Rôle | Email exemple |\n|------|---------------|\n|
    Passager | `marie.ebanda@gmail.com` |\n| Chauffeur | `alain.mvondo@vora.cm` |\n\n---\n\n##
    Parcours passager (flow)\n\n```\nGET /carrefours?city=Yaoundé\n    ↓\nPOST /rides/estimate
    \ { pickup_carrefour_id, destination_carrefour_id, ride_type }\n    ↓\nPOST /rides/request
    \  { payment_method: cash|momo|om|wallet }\n    ↓\nGET  /rides/{ride_id}/status
    \  (polling statut + chauffeur simulé)\n    ↓\nPOST /rides/{ride_id}/payment  (si
    paiement à l'arrivée)\n    ↓\nPOST /rides/{ride_id}/rate     (note + pourboire
    simulé)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Parcours chauffeur (flow)\n\n```\nPOST /driver/status
    \     { is_online, current_location }\n    ↓\nPOST /driver/corridor    { corridor_id:
    \"Y1\", direction: aller|retour }\n    ↓\nPATCH /driver/cabin-seats/{seat_id}
    \  (occupation sièges, tarif rotation)\n    ↓\nPOST /driver/withdraw    (retrait
    Mobile Money simulé)\n```\n\nCorridor IDs : `Y1`, `Y2`, `Y3` (Yaoundé), `D1`,
    `D2`, `D3` (Douala) — voir `GET /corridors`.\n\n---\n\n## Paiements (simulation)\n\n>
    **Aucun FCFA réel n'est débité.** Toutes les réponses incluent `\"simulation\":
    true`.\n\n| Méthode | Endpoint |\n|---------|----------|\n| MTN MoMo | `POST /payments/mtn-momo`
    |\n| Orange Money | `POST /payments/orange-money` |\n| Espèces | `POST /payments/cash/confirm`
    |\n| Statut | `GET /payments/{transaction_id}/status` |\n\n---\n\n## Géolocalisation
    & optimisation\n\n| Endpoint | Usage |\n|----------|-------|\n| `GET /geo/geocode`
    | Adresse → coordonnées |\n| `GET /geo/route` | Itinéraire Google Maps |\n| `GET
    /zones`, `/carrefours`, `/corridors` | Données de référence |\n| `GET /drivers/online`
    | Chauffeurs disponibles (public) |\n| `POST /geo/verify-destination` | Vérifier
    si destination ∈ corridor chauffeur (PostGIS) |\n| `POST /optimize/turn` | Optimisation
    greedy tournée (jusqu'à 4 passagers) |\n\n---\n\n## Format des réponses\n\nSuccès
    :\n```json\n{ \"success\": true, \"message\": \"...\", \"data\": { ... } }\n```\n\nErreur
    :\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": { \"code\": \"INVALID_CREDENTIALS\",
    \"message\": \"...\" },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-07T00:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n##
    Codes d'erreur courants\n\n| Code | HTTP | Signification |\n|------|------|---------------|\n|
    `INVALID_CREDENTIALS` | 401 | Email ou mot de passe incorrect |\n| `ACCOUNT_NOT_VERIFIED`
    | 403 | OTP non validé |\n| `VALIDATION_FAILED` | 400 | Champs invalides |\n|
    `RIDE_CONFLICT` | 409 | Course déjà en cours |\n| `INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS` | 402 |
    Solde portefeuille insuffisant |\n| `NOT_FOUND` | 404 | Ressource introuvable
    |\n"
  contact:
    name: VORA Engineering
    email: dev@vora.cm
  license:
    name: Proprietary
paths:
  /api/v1/admin/reports:
    get:
      operationId: admin_reports_retrieve
      tags:
      - Admin
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/admin/stats:
    get:
      operationId: admin_stats_retrieve
      tags:
      - Admin
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/admin/zones:
    get:
      operationId: admin_zones_list
      tags:
      - Admin
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: array
                items:
                  $ref: '#/components/schemas/ZoneDetail'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/auth/me:
    get:
      operationId: auth_me_retrieve
      description: Retourne rôle, solde portefeuille, note et statistiques. Nécessite
        JWT.
      summary: Profil utilisateur connecté
      tags:
      - Auth
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MeResponse'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/auth/otp/send:
    post:
      operationId: auth_otp_send_create
      description: Simulation — le code est toujours **1234**. Aucun email réel n'est
        envoyé.
      summary: Renvoyer un code OTP
      tags:
      - Auth
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPSendRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPSendRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPSendRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          description: No response body
  /api/v1/auth/otp/verify:
    post:
      operationId: auth_otp_verify_create
      description: Active le compte et retourne un JWT. Utiliser **1234** en environnement
        de test.
      summary: Vérifier le code OTP
      tags:
      - Auth
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPVerifyRequest'
            examples:
              VérificationTest:
                value:
                  email: marie.ebanda@gmail.com
                  otp: '1234'
                summary: Vérification test
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPVerifyRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPVerifyRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/OTPVerifyResponse'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/auth/signin:
    post:
      operationId: auth_signin_create
      description: 'Retourne un JWT Bearer (24 h) et le profil utilisateur avec `role`
        et `redirect_dashboard`. Comptes seed : voir description générale — mot de
        passe `pass12345`.'
      summary: Connexion email / mot de passe
      tags:
      - Auth
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SigninRequest'
            examples:
              PassagerSeed:
                value:
                  email: marie.ebanda@gmail.com
                  password: pass12345
                summary: Passager seed
              ChauffeurSeed:
                value:
                  email: alain.mvondo@vora.cm
                  password: pass12345
                summary: Chauffeur seed
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SigninRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SigninRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/SigninResponse'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/auth/signup:
    post:
      operationId: auth_signup_create
      description: Inscription avec rôle `passenger` ou `driver`. Pour les chauffeurs,
        `vehicle_plate` est obligatoire. Un OTP est envoyé (simulation) — code fixe
        **1234**.
      summary: Créer un compte passager ou chauffeur
      tags:
      - Auth
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SignupRequest'
            examples:
              Passager:
                value:
                  email: marie.ebanda@gmail.com
                  password: pass12345
                  role: passenger
                  name: Marie Ebanda
                  phone: '+237699112233'
              ChauffeurTaxiJaune:
                value:
                  email: alain.mvondo@vora.cm
                  password: pass12345
                  role: driver
                  name: Alain Mvondo
                  phone: '+237690123456'
                  vehicle_plate: LT 482 CE
                  corridor_axis: Poste Centrale ↔ Bastos
                summary: Chauffeur taxi jaune
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SignupRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/SignupRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '201':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/SignupResponse'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/carrefours:
    get:
      operationId: carrefours_list
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: city
        schema:
          type: string
      - in: query
        name: zone_id
        schema:
          type: integer
      tags:
      - Carrefours
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: array
                items:
                  $ref: '#/components/schemas/Carrefour'
          description: ''
    post:
      operationId: carrefours_create
      tags:
      - Carrefours
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CarrefourCreateRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CarrefourCreateRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CarrefourCreateRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '201':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Carrefour'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/corridors:
    get:
      operationId: corridors_retrieve
      description: 6 lignes seedées (Y1–Y3 Yaoundé, D1–D3 Douala). Filtrer par ville
        avec `?city=`.
      summary: Lister les lignes / corridors taxi
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: city
        schema:
          type: string
      tags:
      - Corridors
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/CorridorListResponse'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/driver/cabin-seats/{seat_id}:
    patch:
      operationId: driver_cabin_seats_partial_update
      description: Gère occupation, type passager (app / rue), tarif et statut paiement
        pour un des 4 sièges.
      summary: Mettre à jour un siège habitacle
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: seat_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Driver
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/PatchedCabinSeatRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/PatchedCabinSeatRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/PatchedCabinSeatRequest'
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          description: No response body
  /api/v1/driver/corridor:
    post:
      operationId: driver_corridor_create
      description: Associe le chauffeur à une ligne urbaine seedée (`Y1`, `D1`, etc.).
        Retourne le nombre de passagers en attente estimé sur les arrêts du corridor.
      summary: Sélectionner un corridor de rotation
      tags:
      - Driver
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverCorridorRequest'
            examples:
              LigneBastos—Poste(Yaoundé):
                value:
                  corridor_id: Y1
                  direction: aller
                summary: Ligne Bastos — Poste (Yaoundé)
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverCorridorRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverCorridorRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          description: No response body
  /api/v1/driver/status:
    post:
      operationId: driver_status_create
      description: Met à jour le statut en ligne et la position GPS du chauffeur.
        Retourne le corridor actif et le nombre de sièges libres.
      summary: Mettre le chauffeur en ligne / hors ligne
      tags:
      - Driver
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverStatusRequest'
            examples:
              EnLigne—YaoundéPosteCentrale:
                value:
                  is_online: true
                  current_location:
                    lat: 3.8667
                    lng: 11.5167
                summary: En ligne — Yaoundé Poste Centrale
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverStatusRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverStatusRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          description: No response body
  /api/v1/driver/withdraw:
    post:
      operationId: driver_withdraw_create
      description: Débite le portefeuille chauffeur et simule un virement MTN/Orange
        — aucun argent réel.
      summary: Retrait Mobile Money simulé
      tags:
      - Driver
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverWithdrawRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverWithdrawRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/DriverWithdrawRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      responses:
        '200':
          description: No response body
  /api/v1/drivers/{driver_id}/trajectories:
    get:
      operationId: drivers_trajectories_list
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: driver_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Driver Trajectories
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: array
                items:
                  $ref: '#/components/schemas/Trajectory'
          description: ''
    post:
      operationId: drivers_trajectories_create
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: driver_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Driver Trajectories
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/TrajectoryCreateRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/TrajectoryCreateRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/TrajectoryCreateRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '201':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Trajectory'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/drivers/{driver_id}/trajectories/{trajectory_id}:
    put:
      operationId: drivers_trajectories_update
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: driver_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      - in: path
        name: trajectory_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Driver Trajectories
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/TrajectoryUpdateRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/TrajectoryUpdateRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/TrajectoryUpdateRequest'
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Trajectory'
          description: ''
    delete:
      operationId: drivers_trajectories_destroy
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: driver_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      - in: path
        name: trajectory_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Driver Trajectories
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/drivers/{driver_id}/trajectories/active:
    get:
      operationId: drivers_trajectories_active_retrieve
      parameters:
      - in: path
        name: driver_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Driver Trajectories
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Trajectory'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/drivers/online:
    get:
      operationId: drivers_online_retrieve
      description: Liste les taximen jaunes actuellement en ligne avec position, sièges
        libres et corridor. Endpoint public — pas de JWT requis.
      summary: Chauffeurs en ligne (public)
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: city
        schema:
          type: string
      tags:
      - Driver
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                $ref: '#/components/schemas/OnlineDriversResponse'
          description: ''
  /api/v1/geo/congestion:
    get:
      operationId: geo_congestion_retrieve
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: zone_id
        schema:
          type: integer
        required: true
      tags:
      - Geolocation
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/geo/geocode:
    get:
      operationId: geo_geocode_retrieve
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: address
        schema:
          type: string
        required: true
      tags:
      - Geolocation
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/geo/reverse-geocode:
    get:
      operationId: geo_reverse_geocode_retrieve
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: lat
        schema:
          type: number
          format: double
        required: true
      - in: query
        name: lng
        schema:
          type: number
          format: double
        required: true
      tags:
      - Geolocation
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/geo/route:
    get:
      operationId: geo_route_retrieve
      parameters:
      - in: query
        name: destination
        schema:
          type: string
        description: lat,lng
        required: true
      - in: query
        name: origin
        schema:
          type: string
        description: lat,lng
        required: true
      tags:
      - Geolocation
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/geo/verify-destination:
    post:
      operationId: geo_verify_destination_create
      description: Used by Spring Boot during matching. Checks ST_DWithin corridor.
      tags:
      - Optimization
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/VerifyDestinationRequest'
          application/x-www-form-urlencoded:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/VerifyDestinationRequest'
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              $ref: '#/components/schemas/VerifyDestinationRequest'
        required: true
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/health:
    get:
      operationId: health_retrieve
      description: Vérifie que le service Django geo/optimization répond.
      summary: Health check
      tags:
      - System
      security:
      - BearerAuth: []
      - {}
      responses:
        '200':
          content:
            application/json:
              schema:
                type: object
                additionalProperties: {}
          description: ''
  /api/v1/optimize/demand-heatmap:
    get:
